  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Winterland/MP_Winterland_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1800\" height=\"900\"></span></strong></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>來自 7.3.0 的全新品質更新！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>冬境樂園——一段魔法聖誕旅程</strong> 是一款充滿節慶氛圍的模組包，將聖誕魔法、白雪與節日裝飾帶入生活。探索雪景風光、聖誕主題村莊，並在充滿冬日歡樂與刺激冒險的世界中，與朋友一同展開精彩任務。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Winterland/MP_Winterland_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1800\" height=\"230\"></p><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong>冬境樂園——一段魔法聖誕旅程</strong> 是一款充滿聖誕魔法、冒險與探索的模組包，背景設定在迷人的冬日景觀中。潛入一個聖誕不僅是慶祝，更是一場史詩體驗的世界！白雪覆蓋的環境、節慶裝飾與充滿節日歡樂的氛圍，讓這款模組包提供獨特的場景，讓你以前所未有的方式享受冬季。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">在你的旅程中，你將發現新的冬季生態域，例如雪林、聖誕裝飾村莊與冰封城堡。從魔法馴鹿到節慶動物，模組包引入了讓冒險更加刺激的生物。此外，你可以展開充滿魔法、隱藏寶藏與挑戰的任務，考驗你的探索技能。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff;font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\">而最棒的部分？這款模組包非常適合與朋友同樂。你可以一起建造最迷人的村莊，參與刺激的戰鬥，或單純在冬夜星空下享受釣魚時光。透過 <strong>冬境樂園——一段魔法聖誕旅程</strong>，聖誕節將成為與你關心之人共享的難忘冒險。繫上你的雪靴，今天就開始旅程吧！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">想和朋友一起玩嗎？</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Winterland/MP_Winterland_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"798\" height=\"155\"></span></a></span></strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:book antiqua, palatino, serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><a style=\"color:#fff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>立即獲取你的專屬 Minecraft 伺服器</strong></a></span><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">，與朋友享受無盡冒險！憑藉頂級效能與可靠運行時間，我們的伺服器確保每位玩家都能擁有流暢有趣的遊戲體驗。使用優惠碼 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>THEWIZARD</strong></a> 可享 </span><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fWizardStudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">25% 折扣！</span></strong></a></span></span></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Winterland/MP_Winterland_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1800\" height=\"230\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1139411/description_b2e805ee-8fac-47bf-b74e-edbea6480e57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"446\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1139411/description_6b0005e6-0a6d-46a1-83b9-04b490072b2d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"446\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1139411/description_82c630a5-bb9b-4a75-a875-31def4eb1d63.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"446\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1139411/description_e13c3616-3a4b-4e17-8dc6-82024caf117f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv\" target=\"_blank\" r